sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sensor as Sensor<br/>(SessionManager)
    participant LoRa as LoRa (host-owned)
    participant Gateway as Gateway<br/>(SessionManager)
    participant RNG_S as RandomSource (sensor)
    participant RNG_G as RandomSource (gateway)

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Sensor-initiated renew (encrypted under CURRENT session key)<br/>Pure-software X25519 ephemeral↔ephemeral ECDH. No SecureElement calls.

    Note over Sensor: start_renew(peer, &mut rng)

    Sensor->>RNG_S: generate_ephemeral_scalar()
    Sensor->>Sensor: pubkey_from_scalar(scalar)
    Sensor->>Sensor: aead::encrypt(old_key, old_prefix, tx_counter, body)
    Sensor->>Sensor: tx_counter += 1
    Sensor->>LoRa: Transmit RenewRequest (AEAD)<br/>{peer_mac[17], frame_type=0x11, prefix[4], counter[8],<br/>ciphertext(sensor_eph_pub[32] X25519) + tag}

    Note over Gateway: handle_renew_request(packet, &mut rng)

    LoRa->>Gateway: RenewRequest (encrypted)
    Gateway->>Gateway: aead::decrypt(old_key, old_prefix, counter)
    alt AEAD auth failure
        Gateway-->>Gateway: Err(VerificationFailed) — old key unchanged
    end
    Gateway->>RNG_G: generate_ephemeral_scalar()
    Gateway->>Sensor: ecdh_from_scalar(gw_scalar, sensor_eph_pub) → shared
    Gateway->>Gateway: derive_session_key(shared, "sigil-renew")
    Gateway->>Gateway: aead::encrypt(old_key, old_prefix, tx_counter, challenge_body)
    Gateway->>LoRa: Transmit RenewChallenge (AEAD under OLD key)<br/>{peer_mac[17], frame_type=0x12, prefix[4], counter[8],<br/>ciphertext(gw_eph_pub[32] X25519, key_lifetime_secs[4]) + tag}

    Note over Sensor: continue_renew(challenge, &mut rng, now)

    LoRa->>Sensor: RenewChallenge (encrypted under old key)
    Sensor->>Sensor: aead::decrypt(old_key, old_prefix, counter)
    Sensor->>Sensor: ecdh_from_scalar(sensor_scalar, gw_eph_pub) → same shared
    Sensor->>Sensor: derive_session_key(shared, "sigil-renew")
    Sensor->>Sensor: update_key(new_key, new_prefix, expire) — counters reset to 0
    Sensor->>Sensor: aead::encrypt(new_key, new_prefix, 0, ack_body)
    Sensor->>LoRa: Transmit RenewAck (AEAD under NEW key)<br/>{peer_mac[17], frame_type=0x13, prefix[4], counter[8], ciphertext + tag}

    Note over Gateway: continue_renew(ack, &mut rng, now)

    LoRa->>Gateway: RenewAck (encrypted under new key)
    Gateway->>Gateway: aead::decrypt(new_key, new_prefix, 0)
    Gateway->>Gateway: update_key(new_key, new_prefix, expire) — counters reset to 0
    Gateway-->>Gateway: Success { peer }

    Note over Sensor,Gateway: Both peers now share the rotated session key.<br/>Gateway never initiates renew (sensor-only).
